            "createdOn": 1751047564,
            "author": {
                "name": "Alexander",
                "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                "username": "pointbazaar"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "We don't have any arrays of bools anymore, and this has been supported by the bindings for a while now, can we just make this common?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "> We don't have any arrays of bools anymore\n\nHow do you know?\n\nEM configs are supposed to be a stable extension point for downstream, \nas you stated [here](https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/79744/comments/4635f6e6_7f553143).\n\nThat's part of the reason why i could not drop support for arrays of EM configs.\n\nMaybe i am misunderstanding the code, but isn't this the code which puts the properties and values from the json configs on DBus?\n\nAny change to the type there could cause major problems in case there is any daemons (upstream or downstream) which rely on this EM quirk."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Christopher Meis",
                        "email": "christopher.meis@9elements.com",
                        "username": "ChriMarMe"
                    },
                    "message": "Not exactly. \n\nThis adds the property/value to the dbus object in memory, but does not execute the placement directly. The `tryIfaceInitialize(iface)`-function places stuff on DBus."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Good to know \ud83d\udc4d\n\nI will close this discussion thread since i consider the quirk to be unavoidable for now. At some point in the future when the EM is cleaned up,\nthis quirk will attract more interest and people can begin their testing to see if there is anything which still requires this special case."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "> How do you know?\n\nAre there any schemas with array of bool?  I'm not aware of any.  I'm not asking to drop support for arrays, but arrays of bool should just be arrays of bools."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "I tried your suggestion to remove the quirk but that does not compile.\nBelow is just a fragment of the full error log.\n```\n../src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.hpp:42:33:   required from \u2018void dbus_interface::addArrayToDbus(const std::string&, const nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::json&, sdbusplus::asio::dbus_interface*, sdbusplus::asio::PropertyPermission, nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::json&, const std::string&) [with PropertyType = bool; std::string = std::__cxx11::basic_string<char>; nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::json = nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::basic_json<>]\u2019\n   42 |         iface->register_property(name, values);\n      |         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n../src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.hpp:111:37:   required from \u2018void dbus_interface::addValueToDBus(const std::string&, const nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::json&, sdbusplus::asio::dbus_interface&, sdbusplus::asio::PropertyPermission, nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::json&, const std::string&) [with PropertyType = bool; std::string = std::__cxx11::basic_string<char>; nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::json = nlohmann::json_abi_v3_12_0::basic_json<>]\u2019\n  111 |         addArrayToDbus<PropertyType>(key, value, &iface, permission,\n      |         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n  112 |                                      systemConfiguration, path);\n      |                                      ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n../src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp:165:33:   required from here\n  165 |             addValueToDBus<bool>(key, value, *iface, permission,\n      |             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n  166 |                                            systemConfiguration, path);\n      |                                            ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n../subprojects/sdbusplus/include/sdbusplus/message/types.hpp:278:25: error: static assertion failed: No dbus type conversion provided for type.\n  278 |     static_assert(!std::is_base_of_v<undefined_type_id, type_id<T>>,\n```\n\nSince the goal of this series is to refactor + cleanup the EM i do not want to go further to dig up this quirk unnecessarily, since as you mentioned it is not used anyways.\n\nWe can always come back to this later on when there is interest since it looks like sdbusplus changes may also be involved."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "ACK.  Lets look at this at some point, but not required for this patch."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "FYI, I did debug this:\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/sdbusplus/+/82035. With that patch the vector<bool> can use the same paths as normal."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Thank you for looking into this \ud83d\ude0a"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.cpp",
                    "line": 167,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Follow-up change in EM for this issue:\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/83054"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.hpp",
                    "line": 102,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "This is a really unfortunate variable name.  Can we come up with a better one?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.hpp",
                    "line": 102,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Christopher Meis",
                        "email": "christopher.meis@9elements.com",
                        "username": "ChriMarMe"
                    },
                    "message": "`AltPropertyType` or `AlternativePropertyType` maybe?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/dbus_interface.hpp",
                    "line": 102,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Renamed to ```SinglePropertyType``` since it's the case without the array."
                }
